Package: go-toolchain-1.26
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libc6
Provides: go-compiler
Description: Go 1.26.8 toolchain for arm64 (binary repackage)
 Official Go 1.26.8 compiler toolchain repackaged as a .deb for
 arm64/aarch64. Installs to /usr/lib/go-1.26/ and provides go and
 gofmt convenience symlinks with a -1.26 suffix. Does not conflict
 with the system Go toolchain.
